<%#
# What to hand over to a person who got a password: the password, the e-mail to sign in with and the address to sign in at

Three read-only fields, each with «Скопировать» (the buttons appear when the script runs; the fields are selected on a click). The password
is the one shown ONCE: this partial is drawn only in the answer to the request that set it. The address is the address of the platform
(FRONTEND_URL, or the one the page was opened on) and the sign-in page of the operators' application.

## Local variables:

- `email`: the e-mail the person signs in with.
- `password`: the password the super admin set.
- `prefix`: the start of the ids of the fields (`client`, `member`); the password has the id `<prefix>-one-time-password`.
%>
<%
  address = SuperAdmin::AppConfigAddresses.sign_in_url(request)
  rows = [
    ['password', t('super_admin.onboarding.password.label'), password, "#{prefix}-one-time-password"],
    ['email', t('super_admin.onboarding.sign_in.email'), email, "#{prefix}-sign-in-email"],
    ['address', t('super_admin.onboarding.sign_in.address'), address, "#{prefix}-sign-in-address"]
  ]
%>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-3" data-testid="sign-in-details">
  <% rows.each do |kind, label, value, field_id| %>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-sign-in="<%= kind %>">
      <label for="<%= field_id %>" class="text-xs text-n-slate-11"><%= label %></label>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <input type="text" readonly value="<%= value %>" id="<%= field_id %>" class="min-w-[10rem] flex-1 font-mono" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" onclick="this.select()">
        <button type="button" class="button button--small button--secondary" data-password-copy data-copy-from="<%= field_id %>"
                data-copied="<%= t('super_admin.onboarding.password.copied') %>" hidden><%= t('super_admin.onboarding.password.copy') %></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
